# 64. 实施阶段分组

## Phase A — Architecture Foundation

```text
NODE-00 ~ NODE-04
```

目标：

```text
协议和身份不返工
```

## Phase B — Browser Capture

```text
NODE-05 ~ NODE-21
```

目标：

```text
Web → .wtf
```

## Phase C — Figma Reconstruction

```text
NODE-22 ~ NODE-28
```

目标：

```text
.wtf → Figma
```

## Phase D — Product Quality
